turn_index":270,"locator":"[S15T14]","raw_turn_sha256":"38d6097090a444b8264cd498b81b8e50efd4aa5f4c5ed83e4b13f0016793f251","rendered_turn_sha256":"e3f94d97146802c436d3a95e6c71f42dd9c81ca8761b2f5f8629b54a47544ecc","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"5d322b909784cb91bf4fdeaa6367652fb92db21cf641f5b6119c56d4ec7a7521","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":14},{"dia_id":"D15:15","global_turn_index":271,"locator":"[S15T15]","raw_turn_sha256":"4cd662a8287360452e0fa136e9faa6fc8f7e8017d6ac2c5510de869f42bead4f","rendered_turn_sha256":"b846f6abd94989063ff462adac6e06758c25f0508644bc69369d4f73e919707d","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"22c5f44a590f8f6de08898b27f0c1f43e4bcc792b2a5c9b57026a3a086fb8dad","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":15}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! Haven't talked in a while! Last Friday I had a card-night with my friends, it was so much fun. We laughed and had a great time! Take a look at the photo!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of men sitting at a table with playing cards]\n[S15T1] (dia_id: D15:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave! Great to hear from you, card night sounds like a blast! Always love having fun with friends. Guess what? I scored a deal to continue collaboration with Frank Ocean! This is a dream come true for me, I've been working hard and it's finally paying off. No words can describe how happy I am.\n[S15T2] (dia_id: D15:2)\n\nDave: Wow Calvin, congrats! Super excited for you. How did this chance come up?\n[S15T3] (dia_id: D15:3)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I had the opportunity to meet Frank Ocean at a music festival in Tokyo and we clicked. We've been speaking and sharing ideas we arranged a meeting and recorded a song in the studio at my mansion - it's been great!\n[S15T4] (dia_id: D15:4)\n\nDave: Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!\n[S15T5] (dia_id: D15:5)\n\nCalvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people sitting on the grass at night]\n[S15T6] (dia_id: D15:6)\n\nDave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience.\n[S15T7] (dia_id: D15:7)\n\nCalvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\n[S15T8] (dia_id: D15:8)\n\nDave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?\n[S15T9] (dia_id: D15:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!\n[S15T10] (dia_id: D15:10)\n\nDave: Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\n[S15T11] (dia_id: D15:11)\n\nCalvin: Of course, Dave can't wait to catch up! I almost forgot, yesterday my friends and I recorded a podcast where we discuss the rapidly evolving rap industry!\n[S15T12] (dia_id: D15:12)\n\nDave: That sounds fantastic! I'm looking forward to listening to your podcast and learning more about the rap industry. Keep up the great work!\n[S15T13] (dia_id: D15:13)\n\nCalvin: I'll let you know when the podcast will be uploaded. Take care!\n[S15T14] (dia_id: D15:14)\n\nDave: Sure, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing about it. See ya then!\n[S15T15] (dia_id: D15:15)","text_sha256":"268a67217debb04ae07af042c469f0771f9e8c3fe188076216afe9b70a22d869","timestamp":"2023-08-22T11:06:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8