ex":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Hey Dave! Met with the creative team for my album yesterday. It was a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together. \n[S8T1] (dia_id: D8:1)\n\nDave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took.\n[Image caption: a photography of a pond with a boat in it surrounded by trees]\n[S8T2] (dia_id: D8:2)\n\nCalvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?\n[Image caption: a photo of a recording studio with a large window and a desk]\n[S8T3] (dia_id: D8:3)\n\nDave: Hey, nice photo of the studio! Working in a team yields incredible results, well done! Keep pushing it! I've been doing good - thanks for asking. I've been exploring some parks on the weekends to relax - it's so peaceful being surrounded by nature. Are there any chill spots you enjoy in Boston?\n[S8T4] (dia_id: D8:4)\n\nCalvin: Thanks! That studio is great for creativity. I've never been to Boston before, but I hear the parks are amazing. Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?\n[Image caption: a photo of a tree with pink flowers in the foreground]\n[S8T5] (dia_id: D8:5)\n\nDave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\n[S8T6] (dia_id: D8:6)\n\nCalvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?\n[Image caption: a photo of a path going up a hill with a view of the mountains]\n[S8T7] (dia_id: D8:7)\n\nDave: Nah, haven't gone hiking recently, but it's awesome - being in nature and pushing yourself to new heights. Clears your mind and brings a sense of calm. Have you been to the mountains before? Heard they're super chill.\n[S8T8] (dia_id: D8:8)","text_sha256":"6bc808bfa3823f4259eb8c96864382c8774305771e714ce0cd1e0511f55ee702","timestamp":"2023-06-09T14:31:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":360,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":14856,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":15216},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What kind of music has Calvin been creating lately?","question_id":"conv-50-q090","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":15,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"b82f0cacf6ea995a3505aa60f59cbe2f3996ab2b71fae757991650ff0c8e77d1","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":4,"runtime_sha256":"693ca84094f8f85e9fe24b54d13604fa6c2f8d64e282e7b8c7e96bb88f3762d0"},"schema_version":1,"